Package: indigosky-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: xfce4, xfce4-terminal, dbus-x11, tigervnc-standalone-server, mousepad, xinit, materia-gtk-theme, galculator, bc, indigo-control-panel, ain-imager
Conflicts: indigosky-desktop-indigo3, indigo-control-panel-indigo3, ain-imager-indigo3
Replaces: indigosky-desktop-indigo3
Description: IndigoSky Desktop environment
 IndigoSky is a Linux distribution for astro photography based on indigo framework.
 This package installs a light weight graphical user environment and remote desktop service on top of the standard IndigoSky Distribution.

Package: indigosky-desktop-indigo3
Architecture: all
Depends: xfce4, xfce4-terminal, dbus-x11, tigervnc-standalone-server, mousepad, xinit, materia-gtk-theme, galculator, bc, indigo-control-panel-indigo3, ain-imager-indigo3
Conflicts: indigosky-desktop, indigo-control-panel, ain-imager
Replaces: indigosky-desktop
Description: IndigoSky Desktop environment (Indigo3)
 IndigoSky is a Linux distribution for astro photography based on indigo framework.
 This package installs a light weight graphical user environment and remote desktop service on top of the standard IndigoSky Distribution.
 This variant uses the Indigo3 framework packages.
